      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَاطِرٌ</span></b>  Any gum <i>that exudes in drops,</i> or <i>comes
forth,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَقْطُرُ</span>,) <i>from trees.</i> (IDrd, K. *) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">القّاطِرُ المَكِّىُّ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَمٌ</span> in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دمو</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  A camel
<i>whose urine continually dribbles.</i> (S, K.)

